地九郡，都彭城。負約，更立沛公為漢王，王巴、蜀、漢中，都南鄭。三分關中，立秦三將：章邯為雍王，都廢丘；司馬欣為塞王，都櫟陽；董翳為翟王，都高奴。楚將瑕丘申陽為河南王，都洛陽。趙將司馬卬為殷王，都朝歌。趙王歇徙王代。趙相張耳為常山王，都襄國。當陽君黥布為九江王，都六。懷王柱國共敖為臨江王，都江陵。番君吳芮為衡山王，都邾。燕將臧荼為燕王，都薊。故燕王韓廣徙王遼東。廣不聽，臧荼攻殺之無終。封成安君陳餘河閒三縣，居南皮。封梅鋗十萬戶。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m026-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m026-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000662","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m026-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000662","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m026-0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"章邯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000605","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m026-0068","start":68,"end":71,"surface":"司馬欣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000606","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m026-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"董翳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000607","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m026-0093","start":93,"end":95,"surface":"申陽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000698","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m026-0106","start":106,"end":109,"surface":"司馬卬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000699","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m026-0117","start":117,"end":120,"surface":"趙王歇","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000674","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m026-0126","start":126,"end":128,"surface":"張耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000676","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m026-0137","start":137,"end":142,"surface":"當陽君黥布","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000656","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m026-0150","start":150,"en